397	## 8. Acceptance criteria
398	
399	- `pytest test/` passes, including the two new test files, with no
400	  regressions in existing forecaster tests.
401	- `from stockpy.forecasters import PatchTSTForecaster, iTransformerForecaster`
402	  succeeds.
403	- `model.fit(X, y).predict(X)` returns shape
404	  `(n_windows, pred_len, n_features)` for both new models.
405	- `model.save_params(path); model.load_params(path)` round-trips weights via
406	  safetensors; reloaded model produces predictions equal to the original
407	  within `atol=1e-6`.
408	- `pycodestyle stockpy/` clean.
409	- `black --check stockpy/` clean.
410	- Annotation coverage test passes for both new files.
411	
412	---
