414	## 9. Out of scope
415	
416	- Channel-mixing PatchTST variant (paper reports channel-independent as the
417	  stronger baseline).
418	- Time-series foundation models (TimesFM, Chronos, MOIRAI-2) — separate spec.
419	- Probabilistic variants of either new model — DMMForecaster covers the Pyro
420	  SVI track.
421	- Refactor of existing encoder–decoder forecasters listed in §2.
